  "title": "Mean and spread, with errors that set the digits",
  "text": "One row per configuration, one column per variable, each cell a value with its error. The error decides how many digits are printed, so a precise value gets more of them (1.963 ± 0.010 beside 1.99 ± 0.01), and a column group per sample puts data beside simulation.",
